    <p>Gentle Reminder an amount of <t t-out="object._ft_reminder_amount_text()">₹0.00</t> against Invoice <t t-out="object.name or ''">INV/001</t> will be due by <t t-out="object._ft_reminder_due_text()">01-Jan-2026</t>.</p>
    <p>Request to clear before due date.</p>
    <p>Fingertip</p>
</div>
        </field>
    </record>
